        "TileImage": "$($repository 9d4e194d-67e5-48a6-819e-172556f40157).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rEarlier today, a concerned employee of the Himmapan Hotel has given the ICA delicate information. He alleges that the People&apos;s Rifles, a rogue marxist terror cell in Thailand, is currently being harbored in the Himmapan by Mrs. Mookjai. He believes Mookjai is an associate of Wichian Liang, their leader. \r\rYour mission is to kill Mrs. Mookjai and all the high-level members of the People&apos;s Rifles. Good luck.",
